---
// 영어 소개 페이지(D11). 한국어 /about/의 번역이다. 문구는 작성자 검수 대상이다.
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../../site.config";

const profile = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "ProfilePage",
  mainEntity: {
    "@type": "Person",
    name: site.author.name,
    sameAs: site.social.map((s) => s.href),
  },
};
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description={`About ${site.name} and its author, ${site.author.name}.`} jsonLd={[profile]} lang="en" alternate="/about/">
  {/* 글 페이지와 같은 흰 카드와 본문 스타일(SPEC §6.1) */}
  <article class="post-body prose prose-slate max-w-none rounded-2xl border bg-card px-6 pt-6 pb-8 md:px-9 dark:prose-invert">
    <h1>What this blog covers</h1>
    <p>{site.description.en} I write mainly about things I have tried and verified myself.</p>

    <h2>How posts are made</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>I sometimes use AI tools to help write drafts.</li>
      <li>Before publishing, I check every post myself for facts, sources, and whether the experience is really mine.</li>
      <li>Facts and numbers come with sources, and information that may change carries the date it was checked.</li>
      <li>English posts are often translations of Korean posts. Translations are reviewed before they are published.</li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
